Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_GeorgiaIntro::
    .string "Mind the buttons. One of them\n"
    .string "shuts a door you're standing in.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_GeorgiaDefeat::
    .string "I did warn you about the doors.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_GeorgiaPostBattle::
    .string "Press them in the wrong order and\n"
    .string "you get to admire the walls.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_PaulIntro::
    .string "The TRICK MASTER built this room\n"
    .string "in a single night, he says.\p"
    .string "It shows, he doesn't say.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_PaulDefeat::
    .string "Fair enough.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_PaulPostBattle::
    .string "Every room here was built in a\n"
    .string "single night. Ask him. Please\l"
    .string "don't ask him.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_TedIntro::
    .string "A KANTO champion in a novelty\n"
    .string "house. What a waste of a morning.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_TedDefeat::
    .string "A good waste of a morning.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_TedPostBattle::
    .string "Go on then, finish it. I want to\n"
    .string "hear what he gives you.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened::
    .string "{PLAYER} wrote the secret word on\n"
    .string "the door.\p"
    .string "The lock turned itself over and\n"
    .string "the door swung wide.$"
